  "body": "It looks like the current wording of step 5 in **[execute a script block](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#execute-the-script-block)** isn't quite Web compatible:\n\n> If the script element is in a document, then set the script element's node document's currentScript attribute to the script element. Otherwise, set it to null.\n\nIn particular, forces `currentScript` to return `null` while executing a script which was downloaded by a script element that was momentarily inserted into a document and then removed before the script was executed.\n",
